    27	Evidence: TAH cache only saves `d_feat`, `order`, and `fov`, not feature id/tick_s/input hashes, at `train/tah_cache.py:67`; TAH training only asserts `d_feat` compatibility at `train/tah_train.py:79-82`; context caches skip existing files without config/hash validation at `train/backbone_kv.py:63-72` and `train/backbone_kv.py:106-116`.
