   279	  dam4sam: {gate_px: 160, every_frame: false, reinit_cooldown: 3, service: dam4sam}   # gate_px → --assoc-gate-px(DAM4SAM 复用该参数)
   280	  memory_seed: committed
   281	  conf_tau: 0.05
   282	  reanchor: {mode: off}
   283	filter: {mode: off}
   284	diagnostics: []
   285	```
   286	
   287	方法 YAML 覆盖当前所有臂：
   288	- 主方法 `ours_final`;
   289	- H-A,即 `ours_final` 加开局消融 `module: head`;
   290	- 开局变体 v2–v4;
   291	- PGIF 的各个变体;
   292	- 外部基线：DAM4SAM、DeepSORT/OC-SORT 关联、reid;
   293	- 语言 head:xattn;
   294	- 诊断臂:oracle_id、oracle_absent、gt_seeded、road_oracle、attrbind。
   295	
   296	`tid_head` 每个取值实际读取哪些 kwarg,在 P0a 生成「参数使用矩阵」。例如 DAM4SAM 复用 `assoc_gate_px`。schema 按这个矩阵校验：只允许当前 head 用到的字段出现。
   297	
   298	### 5.4 种子登记:`configs/seeds.yaml`
   299	
   300	```yaml
   301	seedsets:
   302	  datagen_mvp_v5:   {list_file: runs/tah_v90/b_manifest.json#seeds, purpose: train_data}   # 任意列表(含替补 108+)
   303	  train_dagger_v2:  {ranges: [[97000, 97105]], exclude: [97077], purpose: train}           # 97077:Town02 生成失败
   304	  dev:              {ranges: [[91000, 91020]], purpose: dev}
   305	  dev2:             {ranges: [[93000, 93100]], purpose: dev}
   306	  heldout_opening:  {ranges: [[93100, 93660]], purpose: heldout}
   307	  test:             {ranges: [[95000, 96000]], purpose: test, locked: true}
   308	substitutes: {datagen_mvp_v5: {from_manifest: runs/tah_v90/b_manifest.json#substitutes}}
   309	rules: {disjoint_across_purposes: true, test_requires: [--allow-test, prereg_ref]}
   310	```
   311	
   312	- 种子可以用 `ranges`、`list`、`list_file` 三种方式给出，也可以组合。
   313	- 生成失败需要替补的种子，由替补映射显式记录。
   314	- 实际种子以迁移时核对 `collect_dagger.sh` 等脚本的结果为准。
   315	- 不同用途的种子集重叠时,`acot lint` 报错。
   316	- 使用 test 种子必须加 `--allow-test`,并在实验配置中填写预注册文档的引用(`prereg_ref`)。
   317	
   318	### 5.5 Experiment
   319	
   320	```yaml
   321	# configs/experiments/1004_final_table.yaml
   322	name: 1004_final_table
   323	protocol: sim_proxy_v2@1
   324	seeds: {set: dev, expect: 20}
   325	completeness: {require: all_complete, allow_skipped_reasons: [], pairing: strict}   # 失败即关闭(§12.1)
   326	retry: {infra_attempts: 2, retry_skipped: 0}
   327	arms:
   328	  ours:        {method: ours_final}
   329	  no_pgif:     {method: ours_final, override: {filter.mode: off}}
   330	  pgif_bayes:  {method: ours_final, override: {filter.filter_kind: bayes}}
   331	  open_head:   {method: ours_final, ablation: opening, override: {frontend.opening.module: head, frontend.opening.window: 1}}
   332	  ext_dam4sam: {method: ext_dam4sam}
   333	collect: [ticks, trk, gt_access, scenario]
   334	comparisons:
   335	  - {family: main, a: ours, b: [no_pgif, pgif_bayes, open_head, ext_dam4sam],
   336	     metrics: [committed, longC, longW], test: paired_bootstrap, correction: holm}
   337	```
   338	
