   259	## 4. env → policy 线协议字段(16 项，人工整理，依据 `remote_policy.py`、`policy_server.py`、`env.py`、`policy.py`)
   260	
   261	| 字段 | 内容 | 分类 |
   262	|---|---|---|
   263	| `act.rgb` | S1 camera frame | deployable |
   264	| `act.language` | instruction | deployable |
   265	| `act.proprio` | ego state | deployable |
   266	| `act.step` | tick index | deployable |
   267	| `act.rgb_hi` | k× opening camera at ticks 0/6/12 (--hires) | deployable (protocol frontend) |
   268	| `act.retarget_event` | scripted re-target flag (--retarget-tick) | diagnostic |
   269	| `act.target_color / act.target_bp` | GT target colour / blueprint (always sent today) | diagnostic (attrbind only); must be blanked for every other arm |
   270	| `act.gt_candidates[0] tpos` | GT target world position → build_candidates (target box) and WHERE (ex_source != track) | privileged (box proxy) / diagnostic (WHERE) |
   271	| `act.gt_candidates[1] dstates` | GT distractor states → build_candidates | privileged (box proxy) |
   272	| `act.gt_candidates[2] campose` | ego camera pose → projection, frame_gain | deployable (ego odometry) |
   273	| `act.gt_candidates[3] road_pred_world` | road-graph prediction from the TRUE target (--predict-road / --road-oracle) | diagnostic |
   274	| `act.gt_candidates[4] vis` | ray-cast occlusion flags (--vis-raycast) | privileged (occlusion proxy) |
   275	| `cset.is_target / cset.true_idx / cand.gt_idx` | GT labels created inside build_candidates (policy process) | scoring / collection only; any decision-time read = diagnostic |
   276	| `reply.cand_lite` | is_target, idx, depth, true_idx → scorer | scoring |
   277	| `reply.pred_slot / action / search_mode` | policy outputs | deployable |
   278	| `reset` | carries NO seed today (logs aligned by order) | P1 adds seed |
   279	
