   360	## 6. 行为常量与已知冲突(25 项，人工整理;实现时复核行号)
   361	
   362	| 位置 | 内容 | 分类 |
   363	|---|---|---|
   364	| `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/env.py` | camera fov_deg=90 (run_rollout does not pass it) | scientific |
   365	| `train/config_v5.yaml` | image.fov_deg 90 / width,height 512 / vehicle_size_m / box_min,max_px → policy candidates | scientific |
   366	| `train/config_v5.yaml` | context_cache, stage2_context_cache, ckpt_dir, stage2_ckpt_dir SHARED with config_v5_fov90.yaml | offline (conflict) |
   367	| `train/config_v5.yaml` | split_manifest → missing file → dataset.py naive slice, test split empty | offline (conflict) |
   368	| `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/run_rollout.py` | fps=10, resolution=(512,512); scorer gets fps + max_lost_s only (commit_k NOT bound to --commit-k) | scientific |
   369	| `carla_uav_tracking/config/default.yaml` | environment.max_lost_seconds 18 (scorer truncation; RolloutScorer default 5) | scientific |
   370	| `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/metrics.py` | RolloutScorer commit_k=5, t_fail 2 s, central_frac 0.3 | scientific |
   371	| `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/env.py` | opening hi-res frames at steps 0/6/12; hi-res sensor destroyed at step>=12 | scientific |
   372	| `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/env.py` | expert warm-up 90 ticks; abort if target max speed < 1.2 m/s; spawn failure → skipped | scientific |
   373	| `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/policy.py` | shuffle_seed=0 (not exposed): candidate-shuffle RNG re-seeded at every reset() | scientific |
   374	| `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/policy.py` | TAH lang re-anchor threshold 0.60 (not conf_tau) | scientific |
   375	| `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/policy.py` | DAM4SAM re-init cooldown 3 ticks | scientific |
   376	| `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/policy.py` | crop-DINO 224 px / pad 1.3; reid gallery momentum 0.9; pos depth/100 | scientific |
   377	| `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/eval_asd.sh` | fixed: NET=cyh-carla-net, CONFIG=train/config_v5.yaml, --ckpt runs/stage2_v5/stage2_best.pt, --language-mode neutral, --ex-source track, image acot-uav-train:cu118, timm==1.0.29 pip-installed at start | scientific / infra |
   378	| `runs/asd/iter/launch_wd.sh` | ADAPTER map CARLA port → -graphicsadapter; TM port = tm + 10·(part−1); 5 restarts max | infra |
   379	| `train/tah_cache.py` | DINO vit_small_patch14_dinov2.lvd142m, crop 224/1.3, depth/100, stride 2 (0.2 s); saves only d_feat/order/fov | offline |
   380	| `train/tah_train.py` | compat check = d_feat only; val = slice of the FIRST cache | offline |
   381	| `train/backbone_kv.py` | skips any existing <stem>.npz without config/hash check | offline |
   382	| `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/opening_zoom.py` | AttrScorer ckpts eval_out/opening_attr_{cls,ft}.pt; DINO scales (1.5,2.0) + flip TTA | scientific |
   383	| `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/tick_align.py` | 1 tick = 0.6 s (assumes S2=6); logs → seeds by ORDER of non-skipped episodes | analysis |
   384	| `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/opening_cl.py` | sorted(glob('*.json*'))[-1] → prefers .json.partial over .json; _p[0-9] globs miss part ≥10 | analysis |
   385	| `carla_uav_tracking/rollout/iter_gate.py` | skipped/unscored dropped; first occurrence per seed wins; final > partial per part | analysis |
   386	| `carla_uav_tracking/recording/postprocess.py` | box_min 8 px (config 10) | offline |
   387	| `train/labels.py` | image size 336 (stale) | offline |
   388	| `cyh-carla container` | `python` = 3.8.0 (CARLA client), `python3` = 3.6.9 — launchers must call `python` | infra |

