codex
The code check turned up a real schema contradiction: the text says methods/arms differ by `method.control.*`, but the example protocol still owns `control` fields like `ex_source` and `commit_k`. Since arms are mostly allowed to override only `method.*`, that would make existing behavior knobs hard to vary without violating the framework’s own rules.
